OL,3,APrince William launches #250K fund for
OL,4,Avillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales is launching a new
OL,7,Fregeneration fund to support
OL,8,FPrincetown, the isolated Dartmoor
OL,9,Fcommunity facing an uncertain future
OL,10,Ffollowing the closure of Dartmoor
OL,11,FPrison.
OL,13,FThe Princetown Community Fund will make
OL,14,Fat least #250,000 available to locally
OL,15,Fled social, economic and environmental
OL,16,Fprojects.
OL,18,FGrants of between #500 and #40,000 will
OL,19,Fbe distributed through Devon
OL,20,FCommunities Together, which will also
OL,21,Fprovide support to groups applying for
OL,22,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
